The executor and worker binaries, and the server image that carries them,
embed third-party software, distributed unmodified:

ripgrep 15.2.0 (https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep)
  The static Linux builds upstream publishes for x86_64 and aarch64
  (x86_64-unknown-linux-musl, aarch64-unknown-linux-musl), which the grep tool
  writes into a sandbox and runs there. internal/ripgrep/assets/manifest.json
  pins each by URL and sha256.

